# Synesis Information Systems .gitignore for C/C++ libraries
#
# NOTE (recls 1.9): unlike later lines, this branch retains custom makefiles
# under build/ and Visual C++ project/workspace files (*.dsp / *.dsw). Do not
# add /build/gcc* patterns or a blanket *.dsp ignore.


